    <item>
      <title>Trump says U.S. will get Venezuelan oil flowing again, but some experts say that could take years</title>
      <link>https://justthenews.com/politics-policy/energy/trump-says-us-will-get-venezuelan-oil-flowing-again-could-take-many-years?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</link>
      <description>Ramping up Venezuelan production could take 5-10 years, experts tell Just the News. Infrastructure mismanaged under years of socialist rule need to be repaired or replaced, investors may hesitate to jump into an unstable situation, and today's low oil prices may not entice them.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://justthenews.com/politics-policy/energy/trump-says-us-will-get-venezuelan-oil-flowing-again-could-take-many-years?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</guid>
